{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "4f2da478105e4523",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 0: The Strategy",
            "x": 0,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "96b5538bfe8f43c9",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Decision Tree\n>\n> 1. **n-th Term:** Limit $\\ne 0$? -> **DIV**.\n> 2. **Form:** Geometric? P-Series?\n> 3. **Compare:** Similar to P-Series? -> **LCT/DCT**.\n> 4. **Signs:** Alternating? -> **AST**.\n> 5. **Methods:** Factorials ($n!$) -> **Ratio**. Powers ($n^n$) -> **Root**.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-gradient-135deg\n    ",
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "3"
        },
        {
            "id": "3dcb3884f77b4eb7",
            "type": "sticker",
            "file": "sticker_strategy_think_1766874395893.png",
            "x": -250,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 200,
            "height": 200
        },
        {
            "id": "c79a19c99ca646cb",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> What is a Sequence?\n>\n> An **ordered list** of numbers: $a_n = f(n)$.\n> * Ex: $2, 4, 6...$ ($a_n = 2n$)\n> * Limit approaches $L$? Converges.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-gradient-135deg\n    ",
            "x": 600,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "4"
        },
        {
            "id": "c66e1b9501e34599",
            "type": "sticker",
            "file": "sticker_infinity_loop_1766873740702.png",
            "x": 700,
            "y": -250,
            "width": 200,
            "height": 200
        },
        {
            "id": "1ca9e3cc003b4f15",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> What is a Series?\n>\n> The **SUM** of a sequence: $\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} a_n$.\n>\n> Check **Partial Sums** ($S_k$):\n> $$ S_k = a_1 + ... + a_k $$\n> If $S_k \\to L$, Series Converges.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-gradient-135deg\n    ",
            "x": 600,
            "y": 350,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "4"
        },
        {
            "id": "d60cbdfef48c4f2e",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 1: The Gatekeeper",
            "x": 1200,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "8d985fca5cbd492a",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> n-th Term Test\n>\n> $\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} a_n$\n>\n> * $\\neq 0 \\implies$ **DIVERGES**. (Stop here!)\n> * $= 0 \\implies$ **INCONCLUSIVE**. (Do more tests)\n>\n> > [!warning] Limit = 0 does NOT mean convergence!\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-red\n    ",
            "x": 1200,
            "y": 350,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "1"
        },
        {
            "id": "5a899a6d23324318",
            "type": "sticker",
            "file": "sticker_warning_trap_1766873711847.png",
            "x": 1550,
            "y": 250,
            "width": 150,
            "height": 150
        },
        {
            "id": "3c1f5236acea4782",
            "type": "sticker",
            "file": "sticker_limit_approach_1766873693332.png",
            "x": 1100,
            "y": 400,
            "width": 150,
            "height": 150
        },
        {
            "id": "0216c608c756442f",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 2: Recognized Forms",
            "x": 1800,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "8473e0744d3e40b2",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Geometric Series\n> $\\sum ar^n$\n>\n> * **Converges:** $|r| < 1$\n>   * Sum $S = \\frac{a}{1-r}$\n> * **Diverges:** $|r| \\ge 1$\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-blue\n    ",
            "x": 1800,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "12d1702cde1648c3",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> P-Series\n> $\\sum \\frac{1}{n^p}$\n>\n> * **Converges:** $p > 1$\n> * **Diverges:** $p \\le 1$\n>\n> > [!tip] Harmonic Series ($p=1$) Diverges.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-blue\n    ",
            "x": 1800,
            "y": 525.0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "74650e314e2c4ac1",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 3: Comparison & Integral",
            "x": 2400,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "b79a0fa1e4cd4403",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Direct Comparison (DCT)\n>\n> **Intuition:** \"Bounded by\"\n>\n> * $a_n < b_n$ (Big Conv $\\implies$ Small Conv)\n> * $a_n > b_n$ (Small Div $\\implies$ Big Div)\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-cyan\n    ",
            "x": 2400,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "6"
        },
        {
            "id": "a1aa4c1a51b546b6",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Limit Comparison (LCT)\n>\n> **Intuition:** \"Grow at same rate\"\n>\n> $L = \\lim \\frac{a_n}{b_n}$\n>\n> * If $0 < L < \\infty$, both behave the **SAME**.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-cyan\n    ",
            "x": 2400,
            "y": 350,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "6"
        },
        {
            "id": "f583e55302c343b4",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Integral Test\n>\n> If $f(x)$ is:\n> 1. Continuous\n> 2. Positive\n> 3. **Decreasing**\n>\n> Then $\\sum a_n$ $\\iff$ $\\int_{1}^{\\infty} f(x) dx$\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-cyan\n    ",
            "x": 2400,
            "y": 700,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "53af9589cc1548c3",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 4: Advanced Tests",
            "x": 3000,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "518c6ffcd2c84ef8",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Ratio Test\n> Best for $n!$ and $c^n$.\n>\n> $L = \\lim |\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}|$\n> * $L < 1$: Conv.\n> * $L > 1$: Div.\n> * $L = 1$: **Inconclusive!**\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-purple\n    ",
            "x": 3000,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "c3892b3b5e57403e",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Root Test\n> Best for $(g(n))^n$.\n>\n> $L = \\lim \\sqrt[n]{|a_n|}$\n> * $L < 1$: Conv.\n> * $L > 1$: Div.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-purple\n    ",
            "x": 3000,
            "y": 350,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "66c0ca5a1ddd4697",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Alternating Series (AST)\n> $\\sum (-1)^n b_n$\n>\n> Converges if:\n> 1. Decreasing ($b_{n+1} \\le b_n$)\n> 2. Limit is 0 ($\\lim b_n = 0$)\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-green\n    ",
            "x": 3000,
            "y": 700,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "5"
        },
        {
            "id": "eb1e81d3ceb14b6a",
            "type": "sticker",
            "file": "sticker_factorial_1766873726961.png",
            "x": 3350,
            "y": -50,
            "width": 150,
            "height": 150
        },
        {
            "id": "99da7e1709874da9",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Step 5: Power Series",
            "x": 3600,
            "y": -100,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "213b3188f22143a3",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Power Series\n>\n> $\\sum c_n (x-a)^n$\n>\n> * Infinite Polynomial.\n> * Find **Radius of Convergence** ($R$) using Ratio Test.\n> * Converges for $|x-a| < R$.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-gradient-135deg\n    ",
            "x": 3600,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "6"
        },
        {
            "id": "129c92536c494ded",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Taylor Series\n>\n> Represents function as series:\n> $$ f(x) = \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} \\frac{f^{(n)}(a)}{n!} (x-a)^n $$\n>\n> **Maclaurin ($a=0$):**\n> * $e^x = 1 + x + \\frac{x^2}{2!} + ...$\n> * $\\sin x = x - \\frac{x^3}{3!} + ...$\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-gradient-135deg\n    ",
            "x": 3600,
            "y": 350,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "6"
        },
        {
            "id": "723598892e1a4c92",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Engineering Applications",
            "x": 2400,
            "y": 1050,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 60,
            "color": "7"
        },
        {
            "id": "9355b2cf3593414e",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "\n> [!cc-header]\n> Real-World Use\n>\n> 1. **Signal Processing:** Fourier Series (Decomposing waves).\n> 2. **Control Systems:** Z-Transform (Discrete signals).\n> 3. **Approximations:** $\\sin \\theta \\approx \\theta$ (Structural engineering).\n> 4. **Finance:** Compound interest modeling.\n>\n> cssclasses: cc-card-o-purple\n    ",
            "x": 2400,
            "y": 1150,
            "width": 400,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "3"
        },
        {
            "id": "74c868184aa6432a",
            "type": "sticker",
            "file": "sticker_application_gears_1766874410019.png",
            "x": 2250,
            "y": 1150,
            "width": 200,
            "height": 200
        }
    ],
